WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.050
God's grace has an effect.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.050
Amen. It absolutely does.

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.090
And whether you've seen it today,
maybe you got a glimpse of it

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.210
as you were reading this passage,
or maybe it just hasn't caught

5
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.130
you yet. Maybe you
haven't seen that.

6
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.290
That's my prayer for you is that
you will realize the effect of

7
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:20.210
God's grace. And like I said
earlier, it's not the freedom to

8
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.210
just go and live life
however you want to.

9
00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.130
It's literally the power of the
Holy Spirit in you that draws

10
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:29.110
you closer to him and
just helps you to live

11
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.980
a more righteous and upright life.

12
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.430
And at the end of the day,
man, isn't that the goal?

13
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.630
You know, we talk about being
in this faith journey and saying

14
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.070
we want to look more like Jesus
and we want to be more like the

15
00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.190
Son, we want to be less of
who we were and more of him.

16
00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:51.110
And we realize
something along the way.

17
00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:52.630
That's actually
really challenging.

18
00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.390
But don't forget this: what
challenges you is what changes you.

19
00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.430
So keep leaning into
these daily sessions.

20
00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.790
Just come here and just remember,
this is just like getting fuel

21
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:06.740
for your soul. If you didn't
fuel up for a workout,

22
00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.890
a physical workout, like,
how's that going to go?

23
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.410
Not as good. So think about it
this way: you are fueling up

24
00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.650
right now for the
workouts of life.

25
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.130
So go out there and have
an amazing workout today.

26
00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.410
Let me pray for you.

27
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.770
Lord, thank you for today.

28
00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.570
Lord, thank you for this
opportunity to just sit still, Lord,

29
00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:28.370
and to just realize the
effects of your grace and God,

30
00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.090
what they do and how they
challenge us, Lord, but how they

31
00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:35.320
change us. That grace is
changing, grace is challenging.

32
00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.910
And grace is refreshing, right?

33
00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:40.710
And it's refining
at the same time.

34
00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:44.390
And so, Lord, thank you that you
don't leave us or forsake us,

35
00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.910
that you're walking right beside
us as we are still trying to

36
00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.390
take your grace into
the workouts of life.

37
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.334
In Jesus' name, amen.

